{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu01_title", "source_sha256": "bc487e62d2a0f44fde891d0897906dbeb1cc619678a56816f7ce53b981f7660e", "ja": "あずさとおでかけ1", "zh": "和梓出门1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1fc00d5ed931174710ada67ad1d7b64bd8aa484c43a3bf41475f635696169304", "ja": "あずさとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与梓一同外出的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7f4490690f9e5a0340a094f8c19835668e48564a83d100912c1478db164edefc", "ja": "（あずささんの青森でのお仕事、順調だな。\nさて、次はりんごの品種見分けクイズか……）", "zh": "（梓小姐在青森的工作进展顺利。接下来是辨认苹果品种的问答吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5b653894cbb088ba95789daa6c0bed3d1b6b55d21c8a012c55b5241ac032ca0c", "ja": "あずささん、次はりんごの品種見分けクイズですが……\nこれ、結構難しいですね。覚えられましたか？", "zh": "梓小姐，接下来是辨认苹果品种的测验……\n这个还挺难的。您都记住了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu01_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "b6f56cc3716a24be66abf41e9f0bf6f8e2e67f19a191414e92bbfefd341046ad", "ja": "ええ。昨日、いただいたりんごを食べながら\n頑張って覚えたので、バッチリです。", "zh": "嗯。昨天一边吃您送来的苹果，一边努力记住了，所以完全没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fa9b61c4566814263951783c20e62228d9031ec3eb165fc4794e81a481ec2d1e", "ja": "えっ、本当ですか？　俺にはあまり見分けがつかなくて\n……どうやって覚えたんですか？", "zh": "咦，真的吗？我实在不太能分辨出来……你是怎么记住的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu01_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "2317a88c0755079974a05da5c9bbcc84ea70dff1e0c4c0263e673e08c06af787", "ja": "よく見ると、それぞれ特徴があるんです。\nそれにあだ名をつけて……。", "zh": "仔细观察的话，其实每个都有各自的特点。\n我还给它们起了昵称……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu01_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "60d862b0c7e3b37c4e54c9e46aef53da33f8bb87262aa7f12df89fadde20ca12", "ja": "こっちはつやつやのつや丸ちゃん、こっちは\n蜜の多いみつ子ちゃん……といった感じです～。", "zh": "这个是油光水亮的小光丸，这个是蜜特别多的小蜜子……大概就是这种感觉～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6d9f5f9f8d9655a2f92ddd1cd8a397b70584f70099f8058b84a04b2a3aa0e3a9", "ja": "なるほど、そんな風に覚えたんですね！　でも、\nそれだと元の品種名を忘れちゃいそうですが……。", "zh": "原来如此，您就是这样记住的啊！不过，这样一来感觉会把原本的品种名忘掉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu01_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "2cd98e9d1cfcd5e27ee4e2b3cec3a72ea468bf3ca43840f769a71da0ac6a33ee", "ja": "あっ……あら？　あらあら……。", "zh": "啊……哎呀？哎呀呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ba7384b584100409225577c78380cd3628b8875424fcd5ef1bbe2f1a3b3ab058", "ja": "え、あずささんまさか……。", "zh": "咦，难道说……是亚美小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7c72c33c432ece86c6f99d888b4cd974478d1f8dad0f438e612b0eca79a82a5d", "ja": "（クイズの成績はふるわなかったが、あずささん考案の\nりんごのあだ名は大ウケだった。結果オーライだな！）", "zh": "（虽然测验成绩不太理想，但由梓小姐想出的苹果昵称大受欢迎。结果还算不错嘛！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
